        "department": null,
        "description": "It is a two credit postgraduate level core course in programming. This course has been designed to improve the programming skills of the students from the perspective of computational biology. This will allow them to learn the fundamentals of python and R, popular languages used for developing tools and softwares for biological applications. The aim is to build a strong foundation that will prepare the students for learning and implementing advance concepts in programming.",
